		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<title>Page not found — Jeremy Lin</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="root-redirect">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">404</p>
				<h1>Lost in representation space.</h1>
				<p>This page could not be found. 找不到這個頁面。</p>
				<nav aria-label="Return home">
					<a class="button" href="/en/">English home</a>
					<a class="button button--ghost" href="/zh/">中文首頁</a>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
